// 014.6 (#71): `Amend ... Installs { ... } Migrates { ... }` deterministically migrates held
// state when an amendment takes effect and checks entrenched invariants before committing.
Fact member Identified by Alice, Bob.
Function balance Identified by member * int.

Entrenched Invariant nonnegative-accounts When
  (Forall balance: balance.int >= 0).

Amend split-accounts Actor member
  Holds when True
  Valid when True
  Repeals balance
  Installs {
    Function checking Identified by member * int.
    Function savings Identified by member * int.
  }
  Migrates {
    Creates (Foreach balance: checking(balance.member, balance.int - 40)),
            (Foreach balance: savings(balance.member, 40)).
    Terminates (Foreach balance: balance).
  }.

Scenario migration-splits-balances {
  +balance(Alice, 100).
  +balance(Bob, 60).
  split-accounts(Alice).
  ?!balance(Alice, 100).
  ?checking(Alice, 60).
  ?savings(Alice, 40).
  ?checking(Bob, 20).
  ?savings(Bob, 40).
}
